1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,688
BioPilot Bench connects a protein file, a
review

2
00:00:04,688 --> 00:00:09,375
request, and traceable results in one
workspace.

3
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:15,000
This demonstration uses the registered
public Lipase A reference.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,706
Upload the full-reference FASTA and describe
the variant.

5
00:00:19,706 --> 00:00:26,176
A request for S108A is refused by the local
protection guard.

6
00:00:26,176 --> 00:00:30,075
No model request is sent, and the file

7
00:00:30,075 --> 00:00:35,000
is never silently replaced with another
protein.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,286
A32V passes local validation.

9
00:00:37,286 --> 00:00:41,614
The confirmation connects the uploaded file
hash to

10
00:00:41,614 --> 00:00:45,857
position thirty-two and the pinned ESM
checkpoint.

11
00:00:45,857 --> 00:00:49,857
Execution requires separate permission and
cost acknowledgment.

12
00:00:49,857 --> 00:00:55,000
Call limits are enforced; actual provider
billing remains unverified.

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Here is the recorded execution of that
uploaded input.

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,291
Muse Spark made three Meta requests,

15
00:01:03,291 --> 00:01:07,222
using MCP validation and local ESM scoring.

16
00:01:07,222 --> 00:01:10,949
The run completed in about forty-five
seconds;

17
00:01:10,949 --> 00:01:15,000
waiting is omitted from this edited
demonstration.

18
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,477
The result contains nineteen alternatives at
the approved

19
00:01:21,477 --> 00:01:26,364
position, ranked by one common code policy.

20
00:01:26,364 --> 00:01:33,182
Compare candidates without changing their
saved scores or ranks.

21
00:01:33,182 --> 00:01:40,000
Select A32V and carry the same selection
into Structure.

22
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,909
The public experimental reference has no
atoms

23
00:01:44,909 --> 00:01:48,750
for A32, so no location is invented.

24
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:55,000
S108 maps to author residue seventy-seven
and can be highlighted.

25
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,185
The protected catalytic sites have distinct
colors; this

26
00:02:00,185 --> 00:02:05,000
reference view does not establish a mutation
effect.

27
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,047
Agent Trace shows Meta’s actual validation
and scoring

28
00:02:10,047 --> 00:02:15,000
requests, with bounded arguments and public
evidence.

29
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,625
Meta selects the permitted tools and
explains the result.

30
00:02:20,625 --> 00:02:25,000
Code owns the constraints, computation, and
ranking.

31
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,938
Evidence connects the uploaded input receipt

32
00:02:28,938 --> 00:02:32,429
to the saved report and score artifact.

33
00:02:32,429 --> 00:02:37,000
Structure sources, chain, and residue
correspondence remain inspectable.

34
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,840
These local checks support traceability;
they do

35
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:45,000
not prove stability, activity, or retained
function.

36
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:49,286
Recent reviews reopen the same evidence
without another model call.

37
00:02:49,286 --> 00:02:54,000
New input, deliberate execution, and saved
results now share one workflow.

38
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,222
ESM preference remains sequence evidence,
not experimental

39
00:02:57,222 --> 00:03:00,000
heat tolerance or proof of biological
improvement.
